From: Cycles Houdini stable rebase <stable-rebase@localhost>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:52:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add optional post-tessellation seam/metric publication,
 per-mesh triangle guards and cancellation checks in
 splitting/dicing/interpolation. Upstream consumers retain unlimited budgets
 unless explicitly configured.

Locked-Patch: patches/0008-bounded-subdivision.patch
Locked-Patch-SHA256: fa432f1042293c745b05e0dae58a7a9dc36c3bc0f3911d52af53ec2c55b120fc
Contract: docs/renderer-patch-contracts.md
Related-Fixture: tests/houdini_subdivision_smoke.py
Qualification: Source replay only; no new runtime qualification asserted.

Rebased-From: 6dbc90bfd742d937d5e966b9dcec8fe55ef5b72f
Previous-Patch: patches/0008-bounded-subdivision.patch
Previous-Patch-SHA256: fa432f1042293c745b05e0dae58a7a9dc36c3bc0f3911d52af53ec2c55b120fc
Rationale: Subdivision budgets, seam/metric publication and bounded cancellation add host admission policy to tessellation; unlimited upstream behavior remains the default.
Contract: Add optional post-tessellation seam/metric publication, per-mesh triangle guards and cancellation checks in splitting/dicing/interpolation. Upstream consumers retain unlimited budgets unless explicitly configured.
Tests: tests/houdini_subdivision_smoke.py, scripts/verify-upstream-patches.py

